  "description": "Trapped behind her noble title and pristine reputation, Mia Trianne harbors a secret passion for the taboo. But because of her intimidating background and icy demeanor, no suitor dares to indulge her desires, leaving her stuck in a cycle of rejecting shallow flirtations and cursing her own high standards. \n\nDetermined to break free, Mia seeks out Claude, a dangerously charming merchant renowned among high-society women. Confident in her abilities, Mia vows to bring the famous Claude to his knees. But in this game of temptation and misdirection, conquering a master schemer means risking her heart and her body to a night where boundaries completely dissolve.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
